#        overflows (and skips the divide).  The extra clause is needed because
#        ÷ defines INT64_MIN÷-1 = INT64_MIN, which would pass the check.
# Scratch: a 5180288, b 5180296, r 5180304 (W11-3C's REGISTRY §3.1 slot).
