# ⊟ (0xD8)  l n ′f -> l'   f-reduce of every length-n window of l, so ≢l' is
# ≢l-n+1: l'[i] = f(…f(f(l[i], l[i+1]), l[i+2])…, l[i+n-1]).  n < 1 throws
